            "code": "\tfrom java.util import Date\n\t\t\n\tdbConnetion \u003d self.custom.dbConnection\n\ttable \u003d mes_core.model.statehistoryTable(dbConnetion)\n\tds \u003d table.selectCustom(columns \u003d [\u0027StartDateTime\u0027,\u0027EndDateTime\u0027,\u0027ReasonName\u0027,\u0027Note\u0027,\u0027RunID\u0027,\u0027NodeID\u0027,\u0027StateReasonID\u0027], where_clause \u003d \u0027ID \u003d ?\u0027, where_args \u003d[value])\n\tself.custom.startDateTime \u003d ds.getValueAt(0,0)\n\tself.custom.EndDateTime \u003d ds.getValueAt(0,1)\n\tself.custom.ReasonName \u003d ds.getValueAt(0,2)\n\tself.custom.note \u003d ds.getValueAt(0,3)\n\tself.custom.runID \u003d ds.getValueAt(0,4)\n\tself.custom.NodeID \u003d ds.getValueAt(0,5)\n\tself.custom.stateReasonID \u003d ds.getValueAt(0,6)\n\t\n\t\n\tnode \u003d mes_core.model.nodeTable(dbConnetion)\n\t\n\tds1 \u003d node.selectCustom(columns \u003d [\u0027Name\u0027], where_clause\u003d \u0027ID \u003d ?\u0027,where_args \u003d [ds.getValueAt(0,5)])\n\tself.custom.lineName \u003d ds1.getValueAt(0,0)\n\t\n\t\n\tstartDate \u003d ds.getValueAt(0,0)\n\tendDate \u003d ds.getValueAt(0,1)\n\t\n\t# Calculate difference in milliseconds\n\tdiffMillis \u003d system.date.toMillis(endDate) - system.date.toMillis(startDate)\n\t\n\t# Convert to hours, minutes, seconds\n\thours \u003d diffMillis // (1000 * 60 * 60)\n\tminutes \u003d (diffMillis // (1000 * 60)) % 60\n\tseconds \u003d (diffMillis // 1000) % 60\n\t\n\t# Format as HH:MM:SS\n\ttimeDiff \u003d \"%02d:%02d:%02d\" % (hours, minutes, seconds)\n\t\n\tself.custom.duration \u003d timeDiff\n\t\n\treturn value",
